    "chunk_text": "\ufffd\u00e6m bedde reste drihtnes lichoma on scetan bewunden \u00f0a he w\u00e6s dead for us. MA27A20 \u00d0onne se hre\u00f0mona\u00f0 bi\u00f0 agan, \u00feonne bi\u00f0 seo niht twelf tida lang, ond se d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6t ilce. AP00A1 On \u00f0\u00e6m feor\u00f0an mon\u00f0e on geare bi\u00f0 \u00feritig daga. AP00A2 \u00deone mona\u00f0 man nemne\u00f0 on l\u00e6den Aprelis, ond on ure ge\u00feeode eastermona\u00fe. AP03A1 On \u00f0one \u00feriddan d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 \u00feara haligra f\u00e6mnena gemynd ond \u00f0ara eadigra AP03A4 \u00deis syndon swi\u00f0e m\u00e6re f\u00e6mnan on de virginitate, \u00f0\u00e6t is on f\u00e6mnena bocum. AP03A5 \u00d0as f\u00e6mnan on Dioclitianus dagum \u00f0\u00e6s caseres \u00f0rowedon m\u00e6rne martyrdom for Criste. AP03A7 Se casere hi sealde his gerefan, \u00fe\u00e6s nama w\u00e6s Dulcitius, \u00fe\u00e6t se hi genedde \u00fe\u00e6t hi Criste AP03A9 \u00d0a sona swa he \u00fea f\u00e6mnan geseah, \u00f0a w\u00e6s he onstered mid scondlice luste, ond he eode on AP03A13 \u00d0\u00e6r w\u00e6ron inne geseted hweras ond pannan, ond he \u00fea \u00feurh Godes miht w\u00e6s oncierred AP03A17 Ond \u00fea he ut eode, \u00fea flogon hine his agene m\u00e6n ond wendon \u00fe\u00e6t hit w\u00e6re larbo, \u00fe\u00e6t is AP03A19 \u00deyssa f\u00e6mnena twa Sisinnius se gesi\u00f0 het sendan on fyr, Agapan ond Chonie, ond \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t AP05A1 On \u00f0one fiftan d\u00e6g \u00f0\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s",
